THIS SOFTWARE OVERWRITES STORAGE DEVICES. tools/disk-wipe-bench destroys all
data on every block device it is pointed at. Its safety guards are aids, not
guarantees. You are solely responsible for what you run it against.

This is research code accompanying published experiments. It is not a
certified data-sanitisation product and has not been independently audited.
The security argument rests on the PoSE-DB paper (Bursuc, Gil-Pons, Mauw,
Trujillo-Rasua, 2024, https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.06626); the implementation
here is Amodo Design's own and is not derived from the authors' reference code.

